  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "CPS综合发现F1（50%）、几何RMSD（10%）和声子κ SRME（40%）；分子动力学与双原子任务不计入CPS。发现使用Unique Prototypes子集。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://matbench-discovery.materialsproject.org/",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "发现F1为precision/recall调和均值，DAF是precision除以测试集中稳定材料比例。稳定标签相对固定DFT-MP凸包；CPS另按发现F1 50%、几何RMSD 10%、声子κ SRME 40%聚合。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2308.14920",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        },
